OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 8 JUN
OL,4,G0930FEssential Classics
OL,5,     GGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,6,     Gclassical music, with discoveries
OL,7,     Gand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,8,     Gwith familiar favourites.
OL,9,G1300FClassical Live
OL,10,     GLinton Stephens introduces an
OL,11,     Gafternoon of specially made
OL,12,     Grecordings including Dmitry
OL,13,     GSitkovetsky's arrangement of
OL,14,     GBach's Goldberg Variations live
OL,15,     Gfrom London's Wigmore Hall.
OL,16,G1600FComposer of the Week: Monteverdi
OL,17,     GKate Molleson explores
OL,18,     GMonteverdi's beginnings in
OL,19,     GCremona, with early publications
OL,20,     Gand musical training.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
