OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 8 JUN
OL,4,G1700FIn Tune
OL,5,     GPetroc Trelawny presents live
OL,6,     Gmusic from pianist Charles Owen
OL,7,     Gand violinist Charlie Lovell-
OL,8,     GJones, as well as the jazz duo
OL,9,     GHis 'n' Hers and their band.
OL,10,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,11,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,12,     Gsoundscape of classical
OL,13,     Gfavourites.
OL,14,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,15,     GThe CBSO conducted by Alpesh
OL,16,     GChauhan present a concert of
OL,17,     Gmusic from America which includes
OL,18,     Gthe double timpani concerto by
OL,19,     GPhilip Glass and works by Carlos
OL,20,     GSimon and Rachmaninov.
